# Paths the entire-graph code graph skips, in addition to .gitignore (same
# syntax). These files are tracked in git on purpose — the CGO build links them —
# so .gitignore can't exclude them, but they are vendored, generated tree-sitter
# grammar C, not this project's source. Indexing them produced only
# E_FILE_TOO_LARGE / E_PARSE_ERROR partial failures (some parser.c blobs are
# 30-54 MB) and a false "completeness: degraded", plus irrelevant vendored
# symbols. Skipping them makes `entire graph index` report a clean, honest graph.
parser.c
scanner.c
